# Shared secret qualtricsWebhook requires on every request. Fails CLOSED --
# if this is unset (in this file for local dev, or via the Firebase CLI's
# .env.<project-id> loading for a real deploy) every request is rejected
# with 401 rather than accepted.
#
# Generate one, e.g.: openssl rand -hex 32
#
# Configure the SAME value in Qualtrics on the "Web Service" workflow task
# that POSTs to this endpoint -- either as a custom header
# `x-webhook-secret: <value>`, or (if the header UI isn't available on your
# Qualtrics plan) as `?secret=<value>` on the target URL. See
# functions/index.js for the exact request shapes accepted.
QUALTRICS_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
